# Google Gemini iOS / Quantumult X remote filter
# Maintained in hhvbb23/Profiles (branch: gemini-rules)
# Format: Quantumult X filter .list. Select a single reliable proxy using force-policy.
# Purpose: Gemini iOS app, login, region/streaming connectivity.
# Last updated: 2026-11-10
# Important: region/account eligibility errors may remain even when all traffic is proxied.
#
# Core Gemini app and web frontend
host, gemini.google.com, proxy
host, bard.google.com, proxy
host, robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com, proxy
host, webchannel-robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com, proxy
host, jnn-pa.googleapis.com, proxy
host, waa-pa.clients6.google.com, proxy
#
# Google identity / authentication endpoints
host, accounts.google.com, proxy
host, oauth2.googleapis.com, proxy
host, apis.google.com, proxy
host, www.googleapis.com, proxy
host, identitytoolkit.googleapis.com, proxy
host, securetoken.googleapis.com, proxy
#
# Gemini model and auxiliary APIs
host, generativelanguage.googleapis.com, proxy
host, aistudio.google.com, proxy
host, ai.google.dev, proxy
host, alkalimakersuite-pa.clients6.google.com, proxy
#
# Selected Firebase endpoints occasionally used by Google mobile apps
host, firebaseinstallations.googleapis.com, proxy
host, firebaseappcheck.googleapis.com, proxy
host, firebaseremoteconfig.googleapis.com, proxy
#
# Do NOT include a blanket google.com or googleapis.com suffix in this narrow ruleset.
# Place before broad Google/DIRECT rules and inspect Quantumult X activity logs.
